    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0006",
      "order": 6,
      "text": "SSRIs8–13\n■\n■Evidence demonstrates that plasma levels may be significantly reduced following RYGB\n",
      "bbox": [
        52.0,
        148.51795959472656,
        398.29010009765625,
        157.2254638671875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "4b7015d33361c0c0b12159a90e38c268346e9142cb237df5b16916a32ddf0852"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0007",
      "order": 7,
      "text": "■\n■Malabsorption has been implicated in cases of discontinuation symptoms and loss of effi-\n",
      "bbox": [
        111.9999008178711,
        158.51795959472656,
        405.91766357421875,
        167.2254638671875
      ],
      "text_sha256": "6be6de41e9d51896477b5f77d9b6e165e22d55e88e2a391fdee0ab2086409a79"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0008",
      "order": 8,
      "text": "cacy\n",
      "bbox": [
        121.0,
        168.5154571533203,
        134.74000549316406,
        177.22296142578125
      ],
      "text_sha256": "def7747e01969710f4c4a8e0b10d7c78e0d0e48867b7833ce4bdd311e9c30ac3"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0009",
      "order": 9,
      "text": "SNRIs10,14\n■\n■Duloxetine levels 42% lower after RYGB compared with matched controls\n",
      "bbox": [
        52.0,
        186.1404571533203,
        357.3175354003906,
        194.85049438476562
      ],
      "text_sha256": "f4cf2268ad6b21a775a38ef61e5f79a77770abe0ddd1475f93b6849daf156033"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0010",
      "order": 10,
      "text": "■\n■The absorption of venlafaxine MR capsules seems not to be altered by RYGB15\n",
      "bbox": [
        111.9999008178711,
        196.1429901123047,
        369.4226379394531,
        204.85049438476562
      ],
      "text_sha256": "fb1efad101d42b486abf9c7170df70a7e8dd4915c927637be49a77ce3a6dc919"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0011",
      "order": 11,
      "text": "Mirtazapine16,17\n■\n■Increased appetite and weight gain are possible\n",
      "bbox": [
        52.0,
        213.7679901123047,
        272.84503173828125,
        222.47549438476562
      ],
      "text_sha256": "8c4cd673d36e277617588aa2a727a88068d6b33919251eab29827e632b8bcc79"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0012",
      "order": 12,
      "text": "■\n■Has been used successfully for non-mechanical vomiting after RYGB\n",
      "bbox": [
        111.9999008178711,
        223.7679901123047,
        338.0050048828125,
        232.47549438476562
      ],
      "text_sha256": "5f19c9cd4f0ab9506d5dd83aa0ce81534dcc0649d9df5ccc31a7374f456f5248"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0013",
      "order": 13,
      "text": "TCAs18,19\n■\n■Single case report suggests therapeutic plasma levels can be achieved within usual dose \n",
      "bbox": [
        52.0,
        241.3929901123047,
        402.57257080078125,
        250.10049438476562
      ],
      "text_sha256": "32fb55a29fc9840c373991576853564af1f658c383e13dce6012c03ac708c245"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0014",
      "order": 14,
      "text": "range after RYGB\n",
      "bbox": [
        121.0,
        251.39048767089844,
        176.739990234375,
        260.0979919433594
      ],
      "text_sha256": "2983232c1105b73f536818b34e8c5db01e997123a4bb166322a326a55eaea1ec"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0015",
      "order": 15,
      "text": "■\n■Plasma levels may be increased after significant weight loss; consider monitoring levels and \n",
      "bbox": [
        111.9999008178711,
        261.39300537109375,
        412.97515869140625,
        270.1004943847656
      ],
      "text_sha256": "dd582ef8fec51af3b4aae1f98b6f3f189f4be4566c2ccbd576a90e93862f21d1"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0016",
      "order": 16,
      "text": "reducing dose\n",
      "bbox": [
        121.0,
        271.3905029296875,
        165.87998962402344,
        280.0979919433594
      ],
      "text_sha256": "e26e291c38e6d2988b7ced48933b5746da1c1d6a22d59ba242f4a32cc4dab77d"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0017",
      "order": 17,
      "text": "General summary\n",
      "bbox": [
        52.0,
        288.8354797363281,
        114.10000610351562,
        297.7229919433594
      ],
      "text_sha256": "9bf043f345aa3ee6d953b168a1cd59f619c6a5102c47bc779300eee69d90bf8a"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0018",
      "order": 18,
      "text": "■\n■Antidepressants are the best studied psychotropics in the bariatric population. Current evidence suggests that \n",
      "bbox": [
        51.999900817871094,
        299.01800537109375,
        412.60009765625,
        307.7254943847656
      ],
      "text_sha256": "99af68c7e30f1791d7c070c4f0dcba7c3512176dbab608dcf9535d27c5f50378"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0019",
      "order": 19,
      "text": "antidepressant absorption is reduced after surgery (though studies are mostly limited to SSRIs after RYGB).\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.0,
        309.0155029296875,
        399.70751953125,
        317.7229919433594
      ],
      "text_sha256": "1d3bb15af10914706f54c4050089c59cb997be8a136739f95dcf32769f8e9d45"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0020",
      "order": 20,
      "text": "■\n■Signs of reduced absorption may include the rapid development of discontinuation symptoms and later loss \n",
      "bbox": [
        51.999900817871094,
        319.01800537109375,
        406.3451232910156,
        327.7254943847656
      ],
      "text_sha256": "0e978f11dc9454cd0ac2aec051323a4a93de2cc18c25884834735178ba482ae3"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0021",
      "order": 21,
      "text": "of efficacy.\n",
      "bbox": [
        61.0,
        329.0155029296875,
        95.16999053955078,
        337.7229919433594
      ],
      "text_sha256": "f5deb457a9610a8935c7901f6c8f0897d37160ae0a04e0a329c1f4ab2f449a6a"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0022",
      "order": 22,
      "text": "■\n■Patients require close monitoring as those at risk of reduced absorption cannot be reliably predicted.\n",
      "bbox": [
        51.999900817871094,
        339.01800537109375,
        380.7850646972656,
        347.7254943847656
      ],
      "text_sha256": "d5df002e58a0be7e527482356ac0ebbd72f847d8b178a488484a0c8788fb330d"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0023",
      "order": 23,
      "text": "■\n■The risk of gastric bleeds with bariatric surgery will probably be increased by serotonergic antidepressants\n",
      "bbox": [
        51.999900817871094,
        349.01800537109375,
        396.7375793457031,
        357.7254943847656
      ],
      "text_sha256": "b403ace13d4c564fdf2314dbc58ae6a220295ac720b7bf65546ba90512d1feac"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0024",
      "order": 24,
      "text": "Antipsychotics\n",
      "bbox": [
        48.0,
        389.00048828125,
        116.32000732421875,
        400.8504943847656
      ],
      "text_sha256": "66a87c9d9c00b8fa993ae9a90f576148dfe50f1c930aed10c7efe7d8254d7496"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "page-0844-block-0025",
      "order": 25,
      "text": "Table 10.11  Antipsychotics in bariatric surgery\n",
      "bbox": [
        54.0,
